 "hast": "\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"Callout\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;mb-6 border-emerald-600 bg-emerald-100 dark:border-emerald-400 dark:bg-emerald-900&#x22;}]\"><p><strong>Starting a new project?</strong> Use <a href=\"/create?template=next&#x26;base=base&#x26;rtl=true\">shadcn/create</a> for a fully configured Next.js app with custom themes, Base UI or Radix, and icon libraries.</p></mdx-jsx>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"Steps\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[]\"><h3 id=\"create-project\">Create Project</h3><p>Create a new project using the <code>--rtl</code> flag and the <code>next</code> template.</p><p><strong>You can skip this step if you have already created a project using <a href=\"/create?template=next&#x26;base=base&#x26;rtl=true\">shadcn/create</a>.</strong></p><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest create --template next --rtl\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest create --template next --rtl\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest create --template next --rtl\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest create --template next --rtl\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest create --template next --rtl\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> create</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> --template</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> next</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> --rtl</span></span></code></pre></figure><p>This will create a <code>components.json</code> file with the <code>rtl: true</code> flag.</p><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\">components.json</figcaption><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"{\n  &#x22;$schema&#x22;: &#x22;https://ui.shadcn.com/schema.json&#x22;,\n  &#x22;style&#x22;: &#x22;base-nova&#x22;,\n  &#x22;rtl&#x22;: true\n}\" data-line-numbers=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\" data-line-numbers-max-digits=\"1\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">{</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"$schema\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"https://ui.shadcn.com/schema.json\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"style\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"base-nova\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\" data-highlighted-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"rtl\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#0550AE\">true</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure><h3 id=\"add-directionprovider\">Add DirectionProvider</h3><p>Wrap your application with the <code>DirectionProvider</code> component with the <code>direction=\"rtl\"</code> prop.</p><p>Then add the <code>dir=\"rtl\"</code> and <code>lang=\"ar\"</code> attributes to the <code>html</code> tag. Update <code>lang=\"ar\"</code> to your target language.</p><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"tsx\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\">app/layout.tsx</figcaption><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"tsx\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"import { DirectionProvider } from &#x22;@/components/ui/direction&#x22;\n\nexport default function RootLayout({\n  children,\n}: {\n  children: React.ReactNode\n}) {\n  return (\n    <html lang=&#x22;ar&#x22; dir=&#x22;rtl&#x22;>\n      <body>\n        <DirectionProvider direction=&#x22;rtl&#x22;>{children}</DirectionProvider>\n      </body>\n    </html>\n  )\n}\" data-line-numbers=\"\" data-language=\"tsx\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\" data-line-numbers-max-digits=\"2\"><span data-line=\"\" data-highlighted-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">import</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\"> { DirectionProvider } </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">from</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> \"@/components/ui/direction\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">export</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\"> default</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\"> function</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#8250DF\"> RootLayout</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#953800\">({</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;